  "description": "Reid Bikes Vintage Balance Bike | Toddler balance bike\nA stylish first bike designed to help toddlers develop balance, coordination and confidence, combining classic vintage-inspired styling with a durable steel frame and child-friendly 12\" wheels.\nThe Reid Bikes Vintage Balance Bike is designed for children aged 1 to 3 years who are ready to take their first steps towards riding independently. With no pedals or stabilisers, it allows little riders to focus on developing their balance, steering and coordination at their own pace, helping build the essential skills needed to progress onto a pedal bike when they're ready.\nInspired by the classic styling of Reid Bikes' popular adult vintage bicycles, this toddler balance bike combines timeless looks with practical features. The Hi-Tensile steel frame and fork provide a sturdy construction, while the 12\" wheels with 2.0\" tyres offer a comfortable setup for little riders finding their feet.\nVintage-inspired details include leather-stitch grips and a tan leather-style saddle, giving the bike its distinctive look. Finished with an alloy handlebar and stem, the Vintage Balance Bike is a stylish and practical introduction to cycling for young children.\nThe Reid Bikes Vintage Balance Bike is ideal for:\n\nToddlers aged 1–3 years, taking their first steps into cycling\n\nDeveloping balance and coordination, with a pedal-free design\n\nBuilding riding confidence, allowing children to learn at their own pace\n\nPreparing for a pedal bike, by developing essential riding skills\n\nLittle riders, with a 12\" wheel size and 2.0\" tyres\n\nClassic vintage styling, with leather-stitch grips and a tan leather-style saddle\n\nDurable everyday use, with a Hi-Tensile steel frame and fork",
